WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000 line:90% align:center
A straight line is 180°.
The angles above this line must add up to 180°.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000 line:90% align:center
One angle is 125°.
What is left for the missing angle?

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000 line:90% align:center
Subtract the angle you know.
180° − 125° = 55°

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000 line:90% align:center
Check that the angles add up.
125° + 55° = 180°. Puzzle solved!
